+app starts and kept current by page writes and deletes.

-- `GET /pages`, `GET /pages/:slug`, `PUT /pages/:slug { body }`, `DELETE /pages/:slug`
-- `GET /search?q=` — substring search
+## Run

 ```bash
 npm ci
